                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Assessing Landscape Scale Wildfire Exposure for Highly Valued Resources in a Mediterranean Area</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2015-01-23">23 January 2015</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers c-article-identifiers--cite-list">
                        
                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
